<Base title='Affiliate disclosure'><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The publication</p><h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1></div><article class="prose section"><p>Campground Weekend participates in the REI affiliate program through impact.com under North Shore Family Adventures. We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases made through our REI links, at no extra cost to you.</p><p>Gear sections on the home page and trip planner contain affiliate links, with a disclosure before the first recommendation. Those links are marked as sponsored. REI category links are shopping starting points, not claims that we have personally tested every product. Prices, stock and eligibility can change.</p><p>Official Wisconsin campground reservations and operator links remain ordinary links. Affiliate relationships do not determine our campground coverage or change the tradeoffs we report.</p><p>A link click is not a confirmed booking or commission. We retain useful official links and cover public campgrounds even when no commission is available. Product research will be distinguished from hands-on testing.</p></article></div></Base>
